on NollStallFangaTimer Typ
  [  0] getparam 0 .............................. <Typ>
  [  2] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  3] eq ...................................... <Typ = 0>
  [  4] jmpifz [ 22] ............................ if Typ = 0 then
  [  7] pushint8 34 ............................. <34>
  [ 10] get 7 ................................... <the timer>
  [ 12] pushint8 50 ............................. <50>
  [ 15] pushint8 60 ............................. <60>
  [ 18] mul ..................................... <50 * 60>
  [ 19] add ..................................... <the timer + (50 * 60)>
  [ 20] setglobal 4 ............................. FangaTimer = the timer + (50 * 60)
  [ 22] getparam 0 .............................. <Typ>
  [ 24] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 27] eq ...................................... <Typ = 1>
  [ 28] jmpifz [ 49] ............................ if Typ = 1 then
  [ 31] pushint8 34 ............................. <34>
  [ 34] get 7 ................................... <the timer>
  [ 36] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 37] pushint8 60 ............................. <60>
  [ 40] mul ..................................... <0 * 60>
  [ 41] pusharglist 1 ........................... <0 * 60>
  [ 43] extcall 44 .............................. <float(0 * 60)>
  [ 46] add ..................................... <the timer + float(0 * 60)>
  [ 47] setglobal 4 ............................. FangaTimer = the timer + float(0 * 60)
  [ 49] ret
end
